-- r 32(1): the proceedings must be begun by originating application, or by summons where there is a pending action.
-- src:4946 | 32. —(1) Proceedings for the apportionment of salvage the aggregate amount of which has already been ascertained must be begun by originating application or by summons where there is a pending action. (2) Unless the Court otherwise directs, the originating application or summons and the supporting affidavit must be filed and served at least 14 days before the hearing.
@ref O 33 r 32(1) (src:4946)
